## Original Content
<p>New AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools to better serve our global community of learners and customers Since our recent closing of the Coursera and Udemy combination, we’ve been focused on one priority: delivering more value for learners, partners, and customers. By bringing together our teams and expertise, we’re able to move faster and [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/accelerating-product-and-platform-innovations-across-coursera-and-udemy/">Accelerating Product and Platform Innovations Across Coursera and Udemy</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Following the merger of Coursera and Udemy, both companies are accelerating product and platform innovations, including AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools. This combined effort aims to deliver enhanced value to learners, partners, and customers globally by leveraging shared expertise.

## Key Points
- Introduction of AI-powered learning experiences
- Enhancements in accessibility for educational platforms
- Development of enterprise tools for better customer service
- Strategic focus on accelerating innovations post-merger
- Leveraging combined teams and expertise for faster progress


